{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0526E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你知道《2001：太空漫游》这部电影吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"听说过，不过……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"果然。我也不觉得你有看电影这种文化习惯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"承蒙夸奖。那电影怎么了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"《2001：太空漫游》中有一个名叫HAL 9000的AI，是控制探测飞船的高性能AI。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"它既能和人交谈，也会下国际象棋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"原来如此，总觉得在哪听过类似的东西。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"HAL的塑造确实非常出色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"怎么说？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"HAL接到了一项连船长都不知道的秘密指令。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"那当然不能告诉船员。正是这种压力让HAL发了疯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"发疯？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"没错。当然也有各种不同的解读。HAL接连杀死船员，最后却被船长停止了功能……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"AI的成长、运用、问题……还有对死亡的恐惧。这些洞察都非常精彩。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"所以它对AI研究也有帮助？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":35,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"你怎么这么功利。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"不是有没有用的问题。那部电影给我的，是灵感。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"也就是说，还是有用。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"够了。这部作品出色的地方不只有HAL的塑造。它对人类进化有着丰富的启示，是足以留名电影史的杰作。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":""}]}